From 78f73dfcb00ba45f3179f54c16605d34f520fb76 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 20:45:23 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 5/5] Workspace for admins too: Videos & routes and Documents,
 plus oversight tools

Company admins get the same simplified workspace as workers (Videos & routes
opens first, then Documents); the separate Upload footage tab, Photos tab and
Overview link are hidden for everyone. Admin-only oversight stays: project
setup, site image and boundary, client access, team, billing, deleting.
The admin menu's Upload link becomes Workspace (site capture) and is
highlighted there. Navigation tests updated for the new label.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01HbptFaAKPeT417LTNgj5bU
